                "kind": "non_idempotent_delete",
                "target": "AbortMultipartUpload",
                "summary": "Aborting succeeds with an empty no-content response and, unlike deleting an object, is not idempotent: an upload id that is unknown or already aborted answers the dedicated not-found code.",
